<form class="tool-form" onsubmit="return false"><label class="tool-field"><span>Listening</span><input id="l" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. 6.5" maxlength="4"></label><label class="tool-field"><span>Reading</span><input id="r" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. 6.5" maxlength="4"></label><label class="tool-field"><span>Writing</span><input id="w" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. 6.5" maxlength="4"></label><label class="tool-field"><span>Speaking</span><input id="s" type="text" inputmode="decimal" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. 6.5" maxlength="4"></label></form>
<div class="tool-result" id="out" aria-live="polite"></div>
<div class="tool-note">The average of the four bands is rounded to the nearest half band: .25 goes up to .5 and .75 goes up to the next whole band. The same rule is used for Academic and General Training.</div>
